@Barry Ancona

It's whispered in tales older than the mountains, a nearly forgotten legend.  The ephemeral Barry Ancona Unqualified Stamp of Approval.

I'm am honored to witness this event.  This is even bigger than Mazeroski home run that won the 1960 World Series which I also witnessed (on TV, anyway).

@sotto voce
I always seek out your posts...and this one cleared up three  spots for me that turned out to be 2 errors.  I speak of the actress and the game of Othello and the BOING/BOINK (I actually changed the right entry to the wrong word.)...so, 2 wrong letters for me.
On top of THAT, I had a mammogram first thing followed by another appt for two big injections of steroids to relieve my painful bursitis (both hips)...and shortly I will take DHubby to the VA medical center for an audiology appt (desperately needed, as his hearing even with good aids is pretty bad...he can't hear when an alarm is set off due to a problem, for instance.)  So much for the Golden Years, eh?  LOL

